<td id="A2.T5.2.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_tt"><span id="A2.T5.2.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Value</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A2.T5.2.2" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A2.T5.2.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_t" colspan="2">Model &amp; Architecture</td></tr>
<tr id="A2.T5.2.3" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A2.T5.2.3.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">   Base Model</td>
